# OS
.DS_Store

# Node — the iOS hook needs `xcode` to inject the WidgetKit target, but MABS does not run
# `npm install` for plugin deps. So node_modules/ (xcode + its deps) is VENDORED and committed
# here; cordova-fetch copies it into the installed plugin and the hook resolves it from there.
# node_modules/ is therefore intentionally NOT ignored.
npm-debug.log*

